WEBVTT

00:01.670 --> 00:03.007
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.031 --> 00:04.366
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.390 --> 00:07.606
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.630 --> 00:13.190
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.190 --> 01:31.150
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.310 --> 01:34.550
=Episode 10=

01:36.300 --> 01:37.300
Your Highness.

01:38.000 --> 01:39.000
Your Highness.

01:41.375 --> 01:42.246
How did you do it last time?

01:42.270 --> 01:43.270
Show me again.

01:45.375 --> 01:46.375
Just do it.

02:11.575 --> 02:12.900
This is drawing circles.

02:14.975 --> 02:16.251
Essentially,

02:16.275 --> 02:18.150
everything returns
to primordial nothingness.

02:19.125 --> 02:21.150
You saw it twice and you understand it?

02:24.550 --> 02:25.950
As for the skills,

02:26.900 --> 02:28.860
it's more like borrowing power
and defusing power.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.125
It's true.

02:32.925 --> 02:33.950
Let me think about it.

02:56.550 --> 03:00.075
♪ At the end of the road ♪

03:00.875 --> 03:03.550
♪ Wave my hands ♪

03:04.475 --> 03:06.750
♪ In spite of the regrets ♪

03:07.275 --> 03:10.325
♪ Still smile about the hurried life ♪

03:11.175 --> 03:13.700
♪ The boiling grudges ♪

03:14.875 --> 03:19.125
♪ Let them laugh at my dream ♪

03:19.225 --> 03:21.050
♪ The happy time is never enough ♪

03:21.600 --> 03:25.225
♪ Take the time to travel around ♪

03:25.925 --> 03:29.175
♪ The withered flowers covered in snow ♪

03:29.625 --> 03:32.350
♪ Walk in the world like the wind ♪

03:33.225 --> 03:35.785
♪ Sing a song on a strolling horse ♪

03:36.275 --> 03:40.075
♪ The heroic spirit matters the most ♪

03:40.575 --> 03:44.175
♪ Drink wine along with wind and frost ♪

03:44.250 --> 03:48.375
♪ Cut off the secular thought ♪

03:48.650 --> 03:50.900
♪ The winter leaves overnight ♪

03:51.075 --> 03:54.800
♪ The black hair becomes white ♪

03:58.975 --> 04:02.225
♪ Sing a ballad and walk in the snow ♪

04:02.650 --> 04:05.375
♪ No more fear to live in the world ♪

04:06.275 --> 04:09.050
♪ Love and hatred are gone with the wind ♪

04:09.400 --> 04:13.075
♪ No desire and no comparing ♪

04:13.625 --> 04:17.376
♪ The ferry at the end of the world ♪

04:17.400 --> 04:21.375
♪ Just a person and a horse ♪

04:21.725 --> 04:23.713
♪ How full the life is ♪

04:24.125 --> 04:28.400
♪ The world is in the heart ♪

04:28.800 --> 04:31.725
♪ The misty rain and red chamber ♪

04:33.975 --> 04:38.640
♪ Never stop ♪

04:54.050 --> 04:55.549
You didn't pass out today?

05:03.800 --> 05:05.175
Is the cucumber ripe?

05:05.550 --> 05:06.550
Don't touch it!

05:08.775 --> 05:09.775
Not ripe?

05:11.275 --> 05:12.550
It's my garden.

05:12.900 --> 05:14.301
You don't allow people
to eat your vegetables.

05:14.325 --> 05:15.600
Why do you grow them?

05:16.025 --> 05:17.025
I'm happy to.

05:26.375 --> 05:27.475
I don't believe

05:28.025 --> 05:30.250
you can guard here 24 hours a day.

05:34.375 --> 05:35.390
Just kidding.

05:35.700 --> 05:38.580
As the son of the Lord of North Liang,
how could I steal your vegetables?

05:39.475 --> 05:41.275
What's there you can't do?

05:44.600 --> 05:45.600
It's still early.

05:45.800 --> 05:47.240
I'm going to practice a little more.

05:50.575 --> 05:51.575
Sweet potatoes?

05:53.175 --> 05:54.626
Somehow

05:54.650 --> 05:56.425
I found them in the garden.

05:56.650 --> 05:57.650
I don't want them.

05:58.075 --> 05:59.075
Take them away.

06:10.800 --> 06:11.469
Go away.

06:11.700 --> 06:12.700
Don't bother me.

06:23.625 --> 06:25.200
What are you doing?

06:26.025 --> 06:28.310
It's a good way to practice my hands.

06:30.250 --> 06:31.425
Interesting.

06:36.469 --> 06:37.469
Your Highness.

06:38.375 --> 06:39.405
Miss Jiang Ni

06:39.429 --> 06:42.070
guards the garden every day
like it's forbidden.

06:42.650 --> 06:43.725
You didn't steal

06:44.275 --> 06:45.650
the sweet potatoes, did you?

06:46.250 --> 06:47.486
I'm worried

06:47.510 --> 06:49.150
she would kill you later.

06:50.989 --> 06:52.046
On Mount Wudang,

06:52.070 --> 06:54.070
who dares to take anything
from that girl's garden?

06:56.125 --> 06:57.126
Why does she

06:57.150 --> 06:58.650
like the garden so much?

07:00.575 --> 07:02.190
Probably

07:02.700 --> 07:03.652
she never owned anything

07:03.676 --> 07:05.075
since she was little.

07:56.275 --> 07:57.469
Where is Xu Fengnian?

08:03.900 --> 08:05.589
I'm asking you.

08:06.725 --> 08:08.825
Where are Xu Fengnian and his brother?

08:12.825 --> 08:14.750
This maid doesn't understand mandarin?

08:16.775 --> 08:18.870
Don't step on my vegetables!

08:19.450 --> 08:20.085
How dare you!

08:20.109 --> 08:21.109
Hold on.

08:24.425 --> 08:25.549
Why did you push me?

08:25.975 --> 08:27.310
You ruined my vegetables.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.626
You pushed me for these vegetables?

08:29.650 --> 08:30.686
It's mine!

08:30.710 --> 08:31.750
How unappreciative.

08:31.989 --> 08:33.200
I'll teach her a lesson!

08:33.575 --> 08:35.350
There's nothing to be proud of
to hit a maid.

08:35.800 --> 08:37.189
I'll give you a chance.

08:37.550 --> 08:38.783
Apologize to me now.

08:39.600 --> 08:41.375
You stepped on my vegetables first.

08:41.925 --> 08:43.851
Destroy the garden.

08:43.875 --> 08:44.425
Yes!

08:44.575 --> 08:45.150
Hurry!

08:45.375 --> 08:46.375
- Yes!
- Yes!

09:04.350 --> 09:06.069
I will clean it up for you.

09:06.725 --> 09:07.725
I don't want it anymore.

09:08.325 --> 09:09.350
Burn it later.

09:09.725 --> 09:10.725
Yes.

09:18.475 --> 09:19.990
The roasted sweet potatoes you made

09:20.525 --> 09:22.125
are much worse than what old Huang made.

09:27.575 --> 09:28.575
Your Highness.

09:29.750 --> 09:31.630
Do you practice martial arts
to go to Wudi City?

09:36.675 --> 09:38.100
Do you also think it's impossible?

09:39.300 --> 09:40.500
Why impossible?

09:44.550 --> 09:46.429
Because I'm just getting started,

09:46.775 --> 09:48.829
but Wang Xianzhi has long been peerless.

09:51.700 --> 09:53.025
What should I do then?

09:53.625 --> 09:55.550
I've never started
practicing martial arts.

09:56.850 --> 09:58.630
What does it have to do with you?

10:03.875 --> 10:05.600
Because I'm the best in the world.

10:09.475 --> 10:10.475
You?

10:11.075 --> 10:12.325
The best?

10:13.375 --> 10:14.375
Yes.

10:15.189 --> 10:16.669
I must be the best in the world.

10:17.750 --> 10:20.029
When are you going
to start practicing martial arts?

10:22.725 --> 10:23.950
Never.

10:25.450 --> 10:27.375
And you want to be
the best in the world?

10:28.975 --> 10:30.750
I promised my senior fellow apprentice

10:31.350 --> 10:32.670
that I won't go down the mountain

10:33.069 --> 10:34.549
until I become the best in the world.

10:35.950 --> 10:37.830
However, I have to
go down the mountain one day.

10:39.775 --> 10:41.549
It never occurred to you

10:42.625 --> 10:43.750
that it's impossible?

10:44.900 --> 10:45.949
I believe in myself.

10:47.475 --> 10:49.549
Therefore, you should also
believe in yourself.

10:49.925 --> 10:51.875
You will be able to enter Wudi City

10:52.100 --> 10:53.390
and get back the sword box.

10:59.949 --> 11:02.400
It sounds like two crazy people talking.

11:09.750 --> 11:11.270
If you don't even believe in yourself,

11:12.700 --> 11:14.175
what else can you believe?

11:17.390 --> 11:18.400
Xu Fengnian!

11:20.829 --> 11:22.909
You will be able to enter Wudi City!

11:29.000 --> 11:30.000
Okay.

11:31.900 --> 11:32.909
Hong Xixiang!

11:33.825 --> 11:35.800
I'll wait for you to be
the best in the world!

11:52.125 --> 11:53.125
It's done.

11:54.750 --> 11:55.829
Apologize.

12:09.800 --> 12:10.800
You are going to cry?

12:12.675 --> 12:13.955
Tears don't work.

12:19.400 --> 12:20.405
How dare you!

12:20.429 --> 12:21.429
Don't come over.

12:22.250 --> 12:23.765
I knew it long ago

12:23.789 --> 12:25.230
that tears don't work.

12:27.250 --> 12:28.250
Kneel down.

12:34.375 --> 12:35.655
You want to hit back?

12:35.900 --> 12:37.096
You are a noble person.

12:37.120 --> 12:38.251
You don't need to do it yourself.

12:38.275 --> 12:39.750
It's beneath your dignity.

12:40.750 --> 12:41.750
Slap her.

12:43.200 --> 12:45.150
Until she apologizes.

12:45.400 --> 12:46.051
Yes!

12:46.075 --> 12:47.075
Go ahead!

12:52.450 --> 12:53.625
It's Xu Fengnian.

12:58.925 --> 13:01.444
You must be the son
of the Lord of North Liang.

13:07.425 --> 13:09.069
A brute indeed.

13:09.425 --> 13:10.786
How rude!

13:14.175 --> 13:15.175
Does it hurt?

13:15.450 --> 13:16.450
No.

13:17.475 --> 13:18.709
Did she bully you?

13:20.350 --> 13:21.606
She stepped on my vegetables.

13:21.630 --> 13:22.750
So, I pushed her.

13:23.150 --> 13:24.151
She destroyed my garden.

13:24.175 --> 13:25.630
So, I threw mud on her!

13:26.450 --> 13:28.590
I got back at her expect this slap.

13:28.775 --> 13:30.150
I didn't lose to her.

13:32.450 --> 13:34.309
As the son of the Lord of North Liang,

13:34.350 --> 13:36.100
you can't even discipline a maid well.

13:36.725 --> 13:38.390
What a disappointment.

13:59.300 --> 14:00.549
What do you mean by that?

14:05.225 --> 14:06.276
Apologize.

14:06.300 --> 14:07.300
What do you say?

14:07.675 --> 14:08.801
That girl behind me,

14:08.825 --> 14:10.101
I can bully her,

14:10.125 --> 14:11.125
but

14:11.300 --> 14:12.375
you can't.

14:12.650 --> 14:13.650
Well,

14:14.050 --> 14:16.185
do you want to fight with us

14:16.209 --> 14:17.525
without asking who we are?

14:17.549 --> 14:19.429
Do I need to know a dog's name
before I beat it?

14:19.700 --> 14:21.786
You have a quick tongue indeed,

14:21.810 --> 14:23.815
but I'm afraid you are not
as strong as you think!

14:27.300 --> 14:28.300
Go on!

14:28.400 --> 14:29.789
Just don't kill him!

14:38.675 --> 14:39.955
You put your blade back so fast?

14:45.200 --> 14:46.699
Didn't they say he can't fight?

14:46.975 --> 14:48.486
I think he just starts
to learn martial arts.

14:48.510 --> 14:50.645
His strength and skills are good,

14:50.669 --> 14:51.685
but it's a pity

14:51.709 --> 14:53.875
that he lacks the genuine spirit.

14:56.475 --> 14:58.069
I guess it's the only move you know.

14:59.650 --> 15:01.700
Is this old pale man your lover?

15:04.200 --> 15:05.087
Kill him!

15:05.111 --> 15:06.225
You are courting death.

15:28.775 --> 15:29.975
Hold the blade tight.

15:31.825 --> 15:33.270
Who are you?

15:33.525 --> 15:34.685
Let's just fight.

15:34.709 --> 15:35.765
Why do you care who I am?

15:35.789 --> 15:36.400
You...!

15:36.675 --> 15:37.675
Xu Fengnian!

15:37.850 --> 15:39.270
Do you know who I am?

15:41.525 --> 15:43.005
Sui dug up two luminous pearls

15:43.029 --> 15:44.286
in Mount Tai.

15:44.310 --> 15:45.870
I've heard about it.

15:46.300 --> 15:47.925
Isn't that how you got your name,

15:47.949 --> 15:49.075
Princess Suizhu?

15:51.450 --> 15:53.429
Since you know who I am,

15:53.700 --> 15:54.900
get down on your knees now!

15:56.675 --> 15:58.549
I think you should
get down on your knees.

15:58.875 --> 16:01.100
We got engaged three years ago.

16:01.350 --> 16:02.765
Although I had been away
for three years,

16:02.789 --> 16:04.109
and the marriage didn't work out,

16:04.850 --> 16:07.100
you're still my wife on some level.

16:07.549 --> 16:08.350
Xu Fengnian!

16:08.549 --> 16:09.630
I'm an easy-going person.

16:09.870 --> 16:10.806
You don't need to kneel down at my feet.

16:10.830 --> 16:12.050
Just apologize to her.

16:12.270 --> 16:13.326
You want me, a princess,

16:13.350 --> 16:15.025
to apologize to a maid?

16:15.390 --> 16:16.390
Why is that?

16:18.800 --> 16:19.510
Senior.

16:19.700 --> 16:20.700
Can you win?

16:20.909 --> 16:21.975
Of course.

16:25.700 --> 16:27.850
Because we can fight!

16:28.100 --> 16:29.100
You!

16:33.575 --> 16:35.625
You want to fight against
the Princess of Liyang.

16:36.050 --> 16:36.901
Sun Diaosi.

16:36.925 --> 16:37.925
Yes!

16:38.150 --> 16:39.309
Take them down!

16:42.110 --> 16:43.110
Master.

16:43.525 --> 16:44.851
(Sanqing Hall)
They are halfway up the mountain.

16:44.875 --> 16:47.270
Are we not going to do anything?

16:48.075 --> 16:49.075
Yeah.

16:49.100 --> 16:51.029
One is the Princess of Liyang.

16:51.470 --> 16:53.350
The other is the son
of the Lord of North Liang.

16:54.950 --> 16:57.100
It will cause us trouble
to help either of them.

16:58.950 --> 17:01.025
After Mount Longhu
sent the letter of challenge,

17:01.200 --> 17:03.350
many disciples have left
one after another.

17:03.925 --> 17:04.925
Master.

17:05.175 --> 17:07.269
If we turn to the royal family,

17:07.550 --> 17:08.550
the Mount Longhu

17:08.675 --> 17:10.575
won't be so aggressive.

17:10.875 --> 17:12.606
Isn't it just a competition?

17:12.630 --> 17:13.965
Master's Dahuangting

17:13.989 --> 17:15.828
may not lose to the Longhu Arch-Taoist.

17:16.300 --> 17:17.300
Yeah.

17:17.425 --> 17:19.075
It doesn't matter
whether we win or lose.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.200
What do you mean?

17:23.825 --> 17:25.749
Mount Longhu is just an excuse.

17:26.749 --> 17:29.225
The one who wants
to reorganize the sects

17:30.550 --> 17:32.450
is the one on the throne.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.165
If the capital can support Mount Longhu,

17:36.189 --> 17:38.550
it can also tolerate Wudang Sect.

17:39.575 --> 17:42.335
In recent years, Mount Longhu
has annexed many sects.

17:42.575 --> 17:44.201
They tore down their gates

17:44.225 --> 17:45.350
and moved to the capital.

17:45.775 --> 17:46.975
If we do that,

17:47.250 --> 17:48.750
Wudang Sect will be destroyed.

17:49.025 --> 17:49.646
Yeah.

17:49.670 --> 17:50.826
At least there is a way to live.

17:50.850 --> 17:51.850
Exactly.

17:53.500 --> 17:54.500
Eh.

17:55.275 --> 17:56.275
What do you think?

17:59.700 --> 18:01.830
I can't go to the capital.

18:02.775 --> 18:03.775
Why?

18:04.500 --> 18:05.575
I took an oath

18:06.050 --> 18:07.375
that I won't go down the mountain

18:07.725 --> 18:09.201
until I become the best in the world.

18:09.225 --> 18:11.469
It's not the time for jokes!

18:12.725 --> 18:13.725
Yeah.

18:15.500 --> 18:16.590
You have a point.

18:24.075 --> 18:25.126
- Master.
- Master.

18:25.150 --> 18:25.755
Master!

18:26.050 --> 18:27.050
Master!

18:33.425 --> 18:34.909
You can apologize now?

18:37.400 --> 18:38.630
What do you want?

18:39.175 --> 18:40.425
You don't understand my words?

18:41.025 --> 18:42.310
I want you to apologize.

18:43.850 --> 18:45.375
No need to apologize.

18:45.700 --> 18:47.475
I only want my garden.

18:47.775 --> 18:48.775
What?

18:48.825 --> 18:50.225
Give my garden back to me.

18:50.675 --> 18:51.870
How dare you!

18:52.125 --> 18:53.189
Then don't apologize.

18:53.525 --> 18:54.565
Compensate for the garden.

18:54.650 --> 18:56.590
How much is this shabby garden worth?

18:57.000 --> 18:58.800
I think it's worth
one thousand taels of gold.

19:00.300 --> 19:01.300
Fine.

19:01.725 --> 19:03.030
One thousand taels of gold.

19:03.575 --> 19:04.949
I'll send you the money later.

19:05.100 --> 19:06.100
Later?

19:06.425 --> 19:07.505
Want to welch on your debt?

19:09.150 --> 19:10.310
I have no money now.

19:12.250 --> 19:13.830
What's in your hand?

19:19.025 --> 19:20.975
Is everyone in Wudang Sect dead?

19:40.075 --> 19:41.509
Are you from Wudang Sect?

19:44.150 --> 19:46.550
I am the Master of Wudang Sect,
Wang Chonglou.

19:46.600 --> 19:48.050
Greetings, Your Highness.

19:49.500 --> 19:52.229
I order you
to take these three people down

19:52.450 --> 19:54.009
right now.

19:55.250 --> 19:56.550
I'm ashamed to say

19:57.700 --> 20:01.110
that our sect only cultivates spirit.
We are not good at martial arts.

20:02.575 --> 20:05.015
You even dare to defy the royal order?

20:05.725 --> 20:07.709
We are unskillful
in martial arts indeed.

20:08.175 --> 20:09.870
Sorry to let you down, Your Highness.

20:10.375 --> 20:12.694
You're getting your sect destroyed!

20:16.600 --> 20:18.150
I just heard

20:18.700 --> 20:21.429
that Your Highness mentioned gold
with Young Master Xu.

20:22.400 --> 20:24.965
How about I pay for you first?

20:24.989 --> 20:27.326
But the Princess must write an IOU

20:27.350 --> 20:28.450
with her fingerprint on it.

20:31.150 --> 20:32.150
Very good.

20:32.950 --> 20:35.630
Wudang Sect is going to be
Xu Fengnian's dog?

20:36.150 --> 20:38.189
How can you borrow money
with that attitude?

20:45.000 --> 20:46.025
Take it!

20:52.575 --> 20:54.310
500 taels of gold for one pearl.

20:57.525 --> 20:58.550
Take them all!

21:02.725 --> 21:03.429
Senior.

21:03.500 --> 21:04.580
Please put back your blade.

21:15.675 --> 21:16.725
I'm incompetent.

21:17.175 --> 21:18.725
I embarrassed you, Your Highness.

21:19.100 --> 21:20.300
It has nothing to do with you.

21:21.700 --> 21:22.509
Is it all right?

21:22.600 --> 21:23.600
You need to ask her.

21:38.375 --> 21:39.725
I only want my garden.

21:39.825 --> 21:40.400
You...!

21:40.650 --> 21:42.400
Turn it into the way it was.

21:42.750 --> 21:43.406
Well,

21:43.430 --> 21:44.975
this girl doesn't know what's good.

21:45.250 --> 21:46.570
Why not give the two pearls to me

21:47.050 --> 21:48.310
if she doesn't want them?

21:49.650 --> 21:50.650
I won't give you

21:51.000 --> 21:52.275
what you want.

21:59.650 --> 22:01.025
It's such a waste.

22:01.875 --> 22:03.325
What a spendthrift.

22:04.050 --> 22:05.229
Xu Fengnian.

22:05.650 --> 22:06.769
Wang Chonglou.

22:07.725 --> 22:09.375
Remember today.

22:09.900 --> 22:11.030
Restore this place.

22:11.775 --> 22:12.775
Hurry!

22:20.000 --> 22:21.000
Stop!

22:21.925 --> 22:22.925
What's wrong again?

22:24.725 --> 22:25.850
I thought about it.

22:26.700 --> 22:28.469
Your people are too dirty.

22:28.950 --> 22:30.469
Don't let them touch my garden.

22:31.625 --> 22:33.385
You're humiliating me.

22:35.375 --> 22:37.100
You slapped me on the face.

22:37.575 --> 22:38.709
I humiliated you.

22:40.000 --> 22:42.030
We are barely even now.

22:43.675 --> 22:44.675
You...!

22:44.750 --> 22:45.910
What else do you have to say?

22:47.150 --> 22:48.350
Suit yourself, Your Highness.

22:51.875 --> 22:52.875
Where is Xu Longxiang?

22:53.550 --> 22:55.450
You are here to see my younger brother?

22:56.950 --> 22:57.921
You didn't marry me,

22:57.945 --> 22:59.301
so, you want to become my sister-in-law?

22:59.325 --> 23:00.830
Don't go too far!

23:02.375 --> 23:04.870
My brother has been taken
to Mount Longhu.

23:06.900 --> 23:08.500
Ask Master Wang if you don't believe me.

23:09.625 --> 23:10.975
I can prove it.

23:16.300 --> 23:17.380
Let's go down the mountain.

23:17.550 --> 23:18.700
Yes, Your Highness.

23:19.600 --> 23:20.600
Let's go!

23:31.975 --> 23:32.975
Master.

23:33.350 --> 23:35.030
That was embarrassing for the Princess.

23:36.800 --> 23:38.301
Do you have time

23:38.325 --> 23:39.445
to have a few words with me?

23:41.425 --> 23:42.425
Give me a minute.

23:43.425 --> 23:46.275
I'll wait for you at the waterfall
where you practice martial arts.

23:47.075 --> 23:48.075
I'll be there right away.

23:53.200 --> 23:54.606
Let's go back to North Liang right now

23:54.630 --> 23:56.650
in case the Princess's people
will come after you.

23:57.050 --> 23:58.709
Do you think I'm afraid of her?

24:14.950 --> 24:15.950
Have you cooled down?

24:18.550 --> 24:19.850
I didn't provoke her.

24:20.300 --> 24:21.925
She stepped on my vegetables first.

24:23.900 --> 24:24.900
I know.

24:25.900 --> 24:27.326
She was looking for you.

24:27.350 --> 24:28.750
It's my fault to get you into this.

24:38.250 --> 24:39.949
How about I restore it for you?

24:42.550 --> 24:43.550
Forget it.

24:45.075 --> 24:46.150
This is my fate.

24:47.200 --> 24:48.590
I don't deserve to own anything.

24:49.525 --> 24:50.685
Even when I own something,

24:50.709 --> 24:52.150
I will lose it in the end.

24:53.075 --> 24:54.871
There is no such fate in the world.

24:59.200 --> 25:00.650
My father is dead.

25:01.100 --> 25:02.429
My mother is dead.

25:02.975 --> 25:04.210
My home is lost.

25:04.475 --> 25:05.590
My country fell.

25:07.875 --> 25:10.110
There's no need to restore it!

25:10.250 --> 25:12.070
I was born to owe this world.

25:12.300 --> 25:13.900
I wish it was all ruined.

25:36.650 --> 25:37.750
Your Highness.

25:37.975 --> 25:39.630
I'm incompetent.

25:40.450 --> 25:42.075
Sorry to get you insulted.

25:42.650 --> 25:43.709
Send people to find out

25:44.475 --> 25:46.909
if Xu Longxiang
really went to Mount Longhu.

25:48.025 --> 25:49.425
Yes, Your Highness.

25:50.600 --> 25:52.070
What do you think of Xu Fengnian?

25:52.850 --> 25:53.909
Your Highness.

25:54.275 --> 25:56.030
The man is bold and audacious.

25:56.750 --> 25:58.390
It doesn't matter how bold he is.

25:58.725 --> 26:00.590
The point is whether he is smart enough.

26:04.300 --> 26:06.469
He has a sharp tongue.

26:06.825 --> 26:08.229
I don't think

26:08.350 --> 26:09.709
he is stupid.

26:10.125 --> 26:11.790
I think it's the other way around.

26:12.450 --> 26:14.165
The man is reckless and ignorant.

26:14.189 --> 26:15.790
He is a real idiot.

26:16.700 --> 26:17.700
Your Highness,

26:18.075 --> 26:19.351
why do you have

26:19.375 --> 26:21.250
such a low opinion of him?

26:24.200 --> 26:25.695
The relationship
between the capital and North Liang

26:25.719 --> 26:26.719
is very subtle.

26:27.550 --> 26:29.876
It looks like that the emperor
and the officials are of one mind,

26:29.900 --> 26:31.310
but in fact...

26:31.775 --> 26:33.846
If Xu Fengnian is clever,

26:33.870 --> 26:35.870
he shouldn't reveal my identity.

26:36.525 --> 26:38.269
If things get ugly,

26:38.650 --> 26:40.870
neither North Liang
nor the capital can end it properly.

26:42.425 --> 26:43.425
Oh.

26:44.275 --> 26:47.350
So, you provoked Xu Fengnian on purpose?

26:48.725 --> 26:49.989
We came here for two reasons.

26:50.175 --> 26:52.225
One is Xu Longxiang.

26:52.900 --> 26:53.739
The other is

26:53.850 --> 26:54.976
that I want to see

26:55.000 --> 26:56.080
what kind of person he is.

26:57.475 --> 26:58.976
You really thought I got here in a hurry

26:59.000 --> 27:00.429
just to quarrel with him?

27:01.600 --> 27:04.450
There should be records in the palace

27:04.709 --> 27:06.900
about what Xu Fengnian did every year.

27:07.390 --> 27:08.600
That kind of stuff is useless.

27:09.700 --> 27:11.110
Xu Xiao will die one day.

27:12.100 --> 27:13.975
I must see him in person to know

27:14.275 --> 27:15.830
what the nature of Xu Fengnian is,

27:16.425 --> 27:18.189
and how dangerous he is
to the royal family.

27:20.150 --> 27:22.070
I prepared a lot of means,

27:22.650 --> 27:23.885
but I didn't expect him to be rattled

27:23.909 --> 27:25.150
just because of a maid.

27:26.300 --> 27:28.219
If North Liang is left to such a person,

27:29.025 --> 27:32.025
the Xu family will come to an end.

27:32.425 --> 27:34.300
Your Highness, you are right.

27:59.400 --> 28:00.850
I think your fate is not that bad.

28:03.550 --> 28:05.400
Despite all the suffering,

28:06.250 --> 28:08.625
you ended up being my maid.

28:08.925 --> 28:10.509
It's kind of a silver lining.

28:29.600 --> 28:31.551
That's an attempted assassination.

28:31.575 --> 28:32.975
Shouldn't you give me compensation?

28:33.000 --> 28:34.350
I stabbed the ground!

28:35.825 --> 28:37.006
What's wrong with you?

28:37.030 --> 28:38.325
Stab the ground with a dagger.

28:41.900 --> 28:42.604
Yeah.

28:42.725 --> 28:44.450
You're the smartest one.

28:45.225 --> 28:46.949
You provoked the Princess on purpose

28:47.250 --> 28:49.350
to make her think

28:49.600 --> 28:52.429
that you are an impulsive
and irritable idiot.

29:10.625 --> 29:12.025
I kind of

29:12.875 --> 29:13.875
did it on purpose.

29:15.875 --> 29:17.325
But it's mainly because...

29:21.600 --> 29:22.600
I have a bad temper.

29:27.950 --> 29:29.600
Then you're a real idiot.

29:31.050 --> 29:32.050
What about you?

29:32.975 --> 29:34.525
You knew they outnumber you,

29:34.600 --> 29:35.900
but you still confronted them.

29:36.125 --> 29:37.625
Didn't you ask for trouble?

29:37.975 --> 29:39.766
The world is hard like a stone
and sharp like a weapon,

29:39.790 --> 29:41.325
but I will never give in.

29:42.350 --> 29:42.966
Look at your attitude.

29:42.990 --> 29:45.150
Princess Suizhu must really hate you.

29:46.600 --> 29:47.600
She should hate you more

29:47.700 --> 29:49.150
than she hates me.

29:52.325 --> 29:53.325
Um.

29:54.025 --> 29:55.865
Why should we care about her?
Eat the cucumber.

29:58.775 --> 29:59.826
Don't throw it!

29:59.850 --> 30:01.125
It is good.

30:15.525 --> 30:16.825
There are a few more left.

30:24.175 --> 30:25.575
I hate both of them!

30:27.325 --> 30:29.350
Didn't you do it on purpose,
Your Highness?

30:29.750 --> 30:30.989
I'm still angry.

30:31.800 --> 30:34.429
Xu Fengnian and that maid humiliated me.

30:34.850 --> 30:36.310
How can I swallow my anger?

30:37.850 --> 30:39.850
But he is still
the son of the Lord of North Liang.

30:40.275 --> 30:41.995
I'm afraid it's not easy
to get back at him.

30:42.850 --> 30:44.390
Not only Xu Fengnian,

30:44.900 --> 30:46.229
but also Wang Chonglou.

30:47.350 --> 30:48.989
Based on what just happened,

30:49.425 --> 30:51.390
Wudang Sect is determined
to turn to North Liang.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.909
With the backing of North Liang,

30:54.725 --> 30:56.749
it's also hard
to make a move against Wudang Sect.

30:58.400 --> 31:01.110
Xu Xiao never has a good attitude
towards those sects.

31:01.850 --> 31:03.030
I'm afraid it's just

31:03.475 --> 31:05.200
Wang Chonglou's wishful thinking.

31:19.075 --> 31:20.850
Who's in the way?

31:28.775 --> 31:29.909
Hong Xixiang.

31:31.875 --> 31:33.125
Hong Xixiang?

31:33.975 --> 31:35.575
Wang Chonglou's
junior fellow apprentice?

31:35.900 --> 31:36.900
Yes.

31:39.125 --> 31:40.405
Why are you standing in the way?

31:41.275 --> 31:43.310
My senior fellow apprentice
is determined

31:44.050 --> 31:45.870
to go against the court,

31:46.200 --> 31:47.550
but all other disciples

31:47.850 --> 31:49.310
are willing to set things right.

31:51.675 --> 31:53.400
So, you are going to
go against Master Wang?

31:53.700 --> 31:54.830
Not to go against him,

31:55.275 --> 31:56.676
but to find a way to survive.

31:57.400 --> 31:59.075
I can't let him drag Wudang Sect down

31:59.325 --> 32:00.600
to the abyss.

32:02.550 --> 32:04.749
Wang Chonglou cultivated Dahuangting.

32:05.075 --> 32:07.989
You are a little Taoist.
How do you set things right?

32:08.100 --> 32:09.725
Usually, I can't stop him.

32:10.025 --> 32:11.475
But there is an opportunity today.

32:11.925 --> 32:12.925
Please

32:13.600 --> 32:14.709
follow me back.

32:24.400 --> 32:26.200
Thank you for speaking up for me.

32:32.950 --> 32:35.229
It wasn't for justice,
but for my own benefit.

32:36.050 --> 32:37.286
In that situation,

32:37.310 --> 32:38.526
I spoke up for you,

32:38.550 --> 32:40.590
telling the Princess

32:41.225 --> 32:44.310
that Wudang Sect is following
North Liang's lead.

32:46.125 --> 32:47.885
In fact, you don't need
to help either of us.

32:50.775 --> 32:52.669
How do you think of
the world of martial arts?

32:56.800 --> 32:58.000
It's free without restraint

32:58.250 --> 32:59.310
and desirable.

33:00.025 --> 33:01.685
The world of martial arts

33:01.709 --> 33:03.475
is insignificant.

33:04.100 --> 33:07.225
The fights over power on the court
are the undercurrents

33:09.400 --> 33:11.509
which can stir up huge waves.

33:13.250 --> 33:14.766
The so-called sects

33:14.790 --> 33:17.070
are just a few boats on the water.

33:17.675 --> 33:18.875
Without foundation,

33:18.909 --> 33:20.989
it could topple at any moment.

33:22.700 --> 33:25.405
The two biggest undercurrents
at the moment

33:25.429 --> 33:27.350
are the capital and North Liang.

33:28.075 --> 33:30.630
Wudang Sect is facing a rough sea now.

33:31.250 --> 33:33.245
If we keep being indecisive

33:33.269 --> 33:34.550
and standing aside,

33:35.175 --> 33:37.310
we will be swallowed by the waves.

33:37.749 --> 33:38.909
I think I know it.

33:39.709 --> 33:41.675
Wudang Sect wants to turn to
North Liang?

33:43.075 --> 33:44.435
We just want to protect ourselves.

34:00.050 --> 34:01.050
What does Master Wang

34:01.325 --> 34:02.550
want to do?

34:06.050 --> 34:07.830
You should know

34:07.870 --> 34:09.966
the martial artists
are divided into nine ranks.

34:09.990 --> 34:10.990
I know.

34:12.175 --> 34:14.735
There isn't much to say about
the second rank to the eighth rank.

34:14.900 --> 34:16.777
Let's just talk about the first rank.

34:16.801 --> 34:18.361
Wang Xianzhi must be in the first rank.

34:18.600 --> 34:19.600
That's right.

34:20.300 --> 34:22.285
But there are four levels

34:22.309 --> 34:23.725
in the first rank.

34:24.825 --> 34:26.650
The first level is the Diamond Realm.

34:27.000 --> 34:28.225
Diamond Realm

34:28.500 --> 34:31.189
is the entry for the martial artists.

34:31.250 --> 34:33.500
The body is hard to destroy
and the bones won't decay.

34:34.375 --> 34:36.205
The one who comes here with you

34:36.229 --> 34:37.750
is about at this realm.

34:39.800 --> 34:41.046
After the Diamond Realm,

34:41.070 --> 34:42.375
it's the Void Realm.

34:42.825 --> 34:44.375
It's more amazing.

34:46.050 --> 34:48.300
Jian Jiuhuang once reached that realm.

34:49.225 --> 34:50.225
Old Huang?

34:52.575 --> 34:54.269
You mean he reached
the Void Realm before?

34:54.750 --> 34:56.400
In the battle of Wudi City,

34:56.600 --> 34:57.567
Jian Jiuhuang used

34:57.591 --> 34:59.400
the Ninth Move.

34:59.500 --> 35:02.000
It reached the Celestial Realm.

35:02.875 --> 35:04.034
It was something.

35:04.525 --> 35:05.669
Indeed.

35:06.600 --> 35:08.886
There are very few people

35:08.910 --> 35:10.270
who can enter the Celestial Realm.

35:10.850 --> 35:12.829
Wang Xianzhi in Wudi City

35:13.300 --> 35:15.150
has been in this realm

35:15.325 --> 35:16.669
for half a lifetime.

35:18.050 --> 35:20.200
It's too high to reach.

35:21.025 --> 35:23.070
There are four realms in the first rank.

35:23.925 --> 35:26.176
Diamond, Void, and Celestial.

35:26.200 --> 35:27.200
It's only three realms.

35:27.600 --> 35:30.525
The top one
is called the Immortal Realm.

35:31.725 --> 35:33.269
This realm

35:33.550 --> 35:35.300
is just a legend.

35:35.825 --> 35:37.385
Is there no other realm on top of that?

35:40.525 --> 35:42.829
Above the first rank is the Unity.

35:43.300 --> 35:44.575
What is the Unity?

35:48.100 --> 35:50.470
The four realms are shadowy.

35:51.925 --> 35:53.869
I don't think I can see it.

35:58.075 --> 35:59.891
Why do you tell me

35:59.915 --> 36:01.070
about this?

36:01.400 --> 36:04.070
I heard that you want
to go to Wudi City.

36:04.500 --> 36:07.400
You need to reach
the Void Realm at least.

36:08.350 --> 36:10.225
You are talented,

36:10.650 --> 36:12.400
but you started too late.

36:14.925 --> 36:16.100
That can't be helped.

36:16.206 --> 36:17.406
I'll take my time to practice.

36:20.350 --> 36:24.125
Wudang Sect's Dahuangting
is not the strongest martial art,

36:25.950 --> 36:28.430
but it's definitely special.

36:29.975 --> 36:31.229
How is it special?

36:32.050 --> 36:33.645
Dahuangting can change a person's bones.

36:33.669 --> 36:35.000
I think you know it.

36:36.175 --> 36:37.869
Besides,

36:38.100 --> 36:40.600
the most amazing thing about Dahuangting

36:41.550 --> 36:43.749
is to serve others.

36:44.725 --> 36:45.749
To serve others?

36:47.725 --> 36:49.526
The one who cultivated Dahuangting

36:49.550 --> 36:51.451
can give his genuine spirit

36:52.325 --> 36:53.990
to someone else.

36:56.125 --> 36:57.450
Give away the genuine spirit?

36:57.850 --> 36:59.630
If you all practice Dahuangting

36:59.775 --> 37:01.089
and pass it to one person,

37:01.150 --> 37:02.750
isn't that person
going to be invincible?

37:04.125 --> 37:05.349
Your Highness.

37:05.675 --> 37:07.430
Dahuangting is extremely hard
to cultivate.

37:08.425 --> 37:09.725
In recent years,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.700
except for Master Wang,

37:12.000 --> 37:13.269
no one else acquires it.

37:14.550 --> 37:15.550
That's good.

37:17.475 --> 37:19.430
And there is a catch

37:19.625 --> 37:21.526
that Dahuangting can only be passed

37:21.550 --> 37:23.550
to someone who never
cultivates his genuine spirit.

37:23.625 --> 37:25.150
How much he can absorb

37:25.675 --> 37:27.225
after the transmission

37:27.400 --> 37:28.600
depends on the destiny.

37:29.075 --> 37:30.325
It's only

37:30.600 --> 37:32.200
five or six out of ten most of the time.

37:33.450 --> 37:36.030
You want to pass Dahuangting to me?

37:36.475 --> 37:37.475
Hold on.

37:37.500 --> 37:39.576
What will happen to you after you
pass your genuine spirit to me?

37:39.600 --> 37:41.300
Without my genuine spirit,

37:42.675 --> 37:44.869
I'll die soon.

37:47.575 --> 37:48.655
Are you crazy?

37:50.100 --> 37:51.725
I'm wide sober.

37:52.150 --> 37:53.046
You are going to give up your life

37:53.070 --> 37:54.007
to help me?

37:54.031 --> 37:55.269
We're not even close.

37:55.700 --> 37:56.526
It's not for you,

37:56.550 --> 37:57.550
but for Wudang Sect.

37:58.050 --> 37:59.406
I've made myself clear.

37:59.430 --> 38:00.709
Wudang Sect can only survive

38:01.825 --> 38:04.025
with the backing of North Liang.

38:05.200 --> 38:06.389
Xu Xiao won't agree.

38:06.750 --> 38:07.875
It's not important.

38:09.950 --> 38:13.101
As long as they see me
passing my force to you,

38:13.125 --> 38:14.389
everyone will believe

38:15.275 --> 38:18.450
that Wudang Sect joins
North Liang's side.

38:19.975 --> 38:21.400
Who can see it?

38:33.925 --> 38:36.050
Wang Chonglou wants
to pass his force to Xu Fengnian?

39:06.229 --> 39:09.086
There are clouds
of various colors at dusk.

39:09.110 --> 39:12.349
Close the eyes and look into oneself.

39:13.350 --> 39:16.789
Then I realize I'm in a cave of heaven.

39:17.110 --> 39:20.110
Huangting turns out
to be a blessed land.

40:08.250 --> 40:09.250
(Funeral)

40:11.415 --> 40:14.276
(Childhood Xu Fengnian)

40:14.300 --> 40:15.300
Mother.

40:17.275 --> 40:18.555
(Childhood Jiang Ni) Mother.

40:45.600 --> 40:46.966
Your mother is dead.

40:46.990 --> 40:48.510
She won't come back alive.

40:50.625 --> 40:51.926
But you still have a father,

40:51.950 --> 40:53.110
elder sisters,

40:53.275 --> 40:54.750
and a younger brother.

40:55.575 --> 40:56.575
I...

40:57.050 --> 40:59.481
I'm the only one left in my family.

41:04.470 --> 41:06.389
She will always live in your heart

41:06.675 --> 41:08.100
and look at you.

41:08.600 --> 41:09.606
Wipe your tears.

41:09.630 --> 41:11.325
Don't let her see you cry.

41:31.850 --> 41:32.869
Fengnian.

41:34.700 --> 41:35.700
Fengnian.

41:37.350 --> 41:38.127
Fengnian.

41:38.151 --> 41:39.831
(Wu Su,
Consort of the Lord of North Liang)

44:56.950 --> 45:01.350
♪ The flower of pain ♪
